{"id":"2c288862-ea0a-40e6-a908-ec1a00a96a91","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a4eb2d27eddc588a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/preview-gate.ts","baseline":{"blob":"2eec26f1d9bee8172fd4f53ee14f81f8b003861b","start":0,"end":46},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","Hub","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/hub","\""]},"context":{"after":"2c1cb6475bc215a0"}},"payload":{"text":"A preview's outside calls, decided (RUNNING.md, *Rules*): the service worker asks about a page's fetches, and for its sockets,\nand this answers by the policy, as a run's are, with a rule giving a result in its place. What the policy leaves undecided its\nwindow asks (shell/preview-ask.tsx), and the answer holds until the server stops, or always, as a rule about its site. A\npreview nobody's watching has nobody to ask, so it's given what the call returned last time, or refused. Fails closed: a window\nthat doesn't answer is a refusal.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:16:16.210Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:16:16.210Z"}
{"id":"3124bcae-ff43-43e9-8e97-29bf11a03e22","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"4f052134e2ff1c26","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/preview-gate.ts","baseline":{"blob":"e61dbcb10a7e468053ac88a5ab2ba876b9337e38","start":2264,"end":2598},"shape":{"type":"If","atoms":["if","(","asked",".","answer","===","\"","allow-always","\"","||","asked",".","answer","===","\"","deny-always","\"",")","{","const","scopes","=","scopesOf","(","call",".","capability",",","call",".","resource",")",";","const","{","when","}","=","scopes",".","length",">","2","?","scopes","[","1","]","!",":","scopes",".","at","(","-","1",")","!",";","await","replaceRule","(","undefined",",","{","\"","when","\"",":","when",",","\"","then","\"",":","[","{","\"","action_id","\"",":","asked",".","answer",".","slice","(","0",",","asked",".","answer",".","indexOf","(","\"","-","\"",")",")","}","]","}",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"3ff4869d97a01bcc","after":"497fd9558ff75ae9"}},"payload":{"text":"A rule about the whole site, as what's being held is; or, with no address, about every call of it.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:16:09.246Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:16:09.246Z"}
